# Optional: CARTO dark basemap API key (free tier — carto.com → Basemaps → API key).
# CARTO's tile CDN now requires a key even for public projects; without one the
# map automatically falls back to keyless OpenStreetMap tiles rendered dark via
# CSS (no account, no key, no watermark).
#
# This is a FRONTEND key: it ships in the JS bundle, so it is public by design —
# restrict it to your domains in the CARTO console and set usage limits.
# Local dev: copy this file to web/.env.local. Production: Amplify console env vars.
VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=
